          "jcr:created": "Wed Dec 20 2023 21:28:06 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">System features</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Quad-Lok mechanism</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Secures pins in vertical, horizontal, or diagonal positions</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Calibrated compression or distraction</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">One 360<sup>o</sup> turn of the set screw results in 1mm of distraction or compression</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Multiplanar adjustability</span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Oct 14 2024 21:03:36 GMT+0000",
