          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Thoughtful design</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Static and articulating fixator options&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Features a cannulated hinge designed for accurate placement&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Reduced radiographic profile when compared to traditional pin-to-bar constructs</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Sterile-packaged kit</span></span><br>\n</p>\n",
